      "writtenOn": "2026-03-25T14:42:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would be nice to avoid passing the task manager to the tasks themselves just for this one call. Looks like we\u0027d have to allocate something to pass both the task manager and task pointer to `AsyncTaskManager::RunTask` which doesn\u0027t seem worth it.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 96,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "364afaca94153254c1f6b19559ff0bfaf2a946a8",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
